{"path":"types/is_class","title":"std::is_class","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>is_class","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/is_class","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"std::is_class is a UnaryTypeTrait.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/type_traits\">&lt;type_traits&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> is_class<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>std::is_class</code> is a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnaryTypeTrait\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnaryTypeTrait</em></a>.\n</p><p>Checks whether <code>T</code> is a non-union class type. Provides the member constant <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> which is equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, if <code>T</code> is a class type (but not union). Otherwise, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> is equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>If the program adds specializations for <code>std::is_class</code> or <code>std::is_class_v</code>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> T\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a type to check\n</td></tr></table>\